# ModularSnapshotETL Data Pipeline Schedule
# Runs on the 2nd of each month at 6:00 AM UTC
# (Allows time for end-users to upload the monthly dataset on the 1st)
#
# After a successful run, source files are archived to dataset/<city>/archive/.
# If no new file is uploaded for a month, the pipeline logs an info message
# and exits cleanly (exit code 0).
#              field          allowed values
#              -----          --------------
#              minute         0-59
#              hour           0-23
#              day of month   1-31
#              month          1-12 (or names, see below)
#              day of week    0-7 (0 or 7 is Sunday, or use names)
# To install: crontab /home/user/ModularSnapshotETL/crontab
# To verify:  crontab -l
0 6 2 * * cd /home/user/ModularSnapshotETL && python main.py >> /var/log/modularsnapshotetl_pipeline.log 2>&1
